---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Vitamin D Calculator"
  description="Privacy policy for vitamindcalculator.net. Learn how we handle your data, cookies, and third-party services."
>
  <main class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <nav class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 font-medium transition-colors">
          &larr; Back to Calculator
        </a>
      </nav>

      <header class="mb-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: April 2026</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        <!-- Introduction -->
        <section>
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>vitamindcalculator.net</strong> ("we," "us," or "our"). Your privacy matters to us. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have when using our website.
          </p>
          <p>
            By using vitamindcalculator.net, you agree to the practices described in this policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Information We Collect -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">Location Data</h3>
          <p>
            Our calculator may request your approximate geographic location (latitude and longitude) to estimate UV index and sunlight availability in your area. This data is used solely to perform vitamin D calculations and is <strong>stored locally on your device only</strong>. We do not transmit, store, or retain your location data on any server.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">Calculator Inputs</h3>
          <p>
            Information you provide through the calculator, such as skin type, age, weight, and sun exposure habits, is processed entirely within your browser. This data is never sent to our servers or shared with third parties.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">Automatically Collected Information</h3>
          <p>
            Like most websites, we may automatically collect certain technical information when you visit, including your IP address, browser type, device type, referring URL, and pages viewed. This information is collected through cookies and analytics tools as described below.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Cookies and Tracking -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
          <p>
            We use cookies and similar tracking technologies on vitamindcalculator.net for the following purposes:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>
              <strong>Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our site, including which pages are visited, how long users stay, and general demographic information. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect this data in an aggregated and anonymized form.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Advertising:</strong> We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. AdSense may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. See the "Third-Party Advertising" section below for more details.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Functional cookies:</strong> We may use cookies to remember your preferences and improve your experience on the site.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. Please note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality of some features on the site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Third-Party Advertising -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Third-Party Advertising</h2>
          <p>
            We partner with Google AdSense to display advertisements on vitamindcalculator.net. Google and its advertising partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your browsing history across websites. This practice is known as interest-based or personalized advertising.
          </p>
          <p>
            Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to vitamindcalculator.net and other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
            <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>
            or the
            <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org/" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Network Advertising Initiative opt-out page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- How We Use Information -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the information described above to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>Provide and improve the vitamin D calculator</li>
            <li>Analyze site usage and performance</li>
            <li>Display relevant advertisements</li>
            <li>Maintain and improve site security</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Data Sharing -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Data Sharing</h2>
          <p>
            We do not sell your personal information. We may share limited data with the following categories of third parties:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li><strong>Analytics providers</strong> (Google Analytics) to help us understand site usage</li>
            <li><strong>Advertising partners</strong> (Google AdSense) to display ads on the site</li>
            <li><strong>Legal compliance:</strong> We may disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Your Rights -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
            <li>Request correction or deletion of your personal data</li>
            <li>Object to or restrict certain processing of your data</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
            <li>Request portability of your personal data</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To exercise any of these rights, please <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 underline">contact us</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- California Privacy Rights -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">California Privacy Rights (CCPA)</h2>
          <p>
            If you are a California resident, the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) grants you additional rights regarding your personal information. These include:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>The right to know what personal information we collect, use, and disclose</li>
            <li>The right to request deletion of your personal information</li>
            <li>The right to opt out of the sale of your personal information (we do not sell personal information)</li>
            <li>The right to non-discrimination for exercising your privacy rights</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To make a request under the CCPA, please <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 underline">contact us</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- GDPR Rights -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">European Privacy Rights (GDPR)</h2>
          <p>
            If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) provides you with specific data protection rights. Our legal bases for processing your data include legitimate interest (site analytics and improvement) and consent (personalized advertising).
          </p>
          <p>
            In addition to the general rights listed above, you have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority if you believe your data has been processed unlawfully.
          </p>
          <p>
            To exercise your GDPR rights, please <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 underline">contact us</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Children's Privacy -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            vitamindcalculator.net is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 underline">contact us</a> so we can take appropriate action.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Data Retention -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            Since calculator data is processed and stored locally on your device, we do not retain it. Analytics and advertising data collected by third-party services are retained according to those services' respective privacy policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Changes to This Policy -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this policy periodically to stay informed about how we protect your information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 underline">contact page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <footer class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
        <a href="/" class="text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 font-medium transition-colors">
          &larr; Back to Calculator
        </a>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
